{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39775","headline":"成名後呈同年 · 黄滔","name":"成名後呈同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业诗攻赋荐乡书，二纪如鸿历九衢。\n待得至公搜草泽，如从平陆到蓬壶。\n虽慙锦鲤成穿额，忝获骊龙不寐珠。\n蒙楚数疑休下泣，师刘大喝已爲卢。\n人间灰管供红杏，天上烟花应白榆。\n一字连镳巡甲族，千般唱罚赏皇都。\n名推颜柳题金塔，饮自燕秦索玉姝。\n退媿单寒终预此，敢将恩岳怠斯须。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}